      "desire": "For somebody to finally explain what they're really hunting.",
      "touchstones": "<h3>Touchstones</h3><ul><li>His daughter Kayla, a nurse in San Diego, who sends him pictures of his grandson and doesn&#39;t ask about work.</li></ul>",
