      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>MEN-02 operator, Bear&#39;s former SEAL teammate</td></tr><tr><th>Age</th><td>49</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>Make it to fifty-five with both knees and his full pension.</td></tr><tr><th>Desire</th><td>For somebody to finally explain what they&#39;re really hunting.</td></tr><tr><th>Dice pools</th><td>Physical 6 · Social 2 · Mental 4 · Firearms 7 · Athletics 5 · Awareness 5 · Brawl 5 · Insight 6</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Forty-nine, mustache, wrecked knees. Thinks he works for Homeland Security.</p><p>Forty-nine, mustache, knees as wrecked as Bear&#39;s. Thinks he works for Homeland Security. Absolute loyalty to his teammates, and Bear was one of them.</p>\n<p>Uses the stats of @UUID[Actor.abaWg7NwNQvM0sDc]{FIRSTLIGHT Tactical Team}, with <strong>Insight 6</strong>.</p><h3>Hunter</h3><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Cell</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.dnsWkdXVJ19riBLa.JournalEntryPage.O8yPSIYLlTrKHm8G]{Puget Cell}</td></tr><tr><th>Creed</th><td>Martial. <em>Desperation:</em> Physical conflict during the Hunt (it doesn't have to be with the quarry or with the supernatural).</td></tr><tr><th>Drive</th><td>Oath. <em>Redemption:</em> He finds redemption when he risks something of his own (his job, his pension, his hide) to pull out a brother-in-arms, whatever team they&#39;re on.</td></tr><tr><th>Edges</th><td>Arsenal (Double-Checked)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>An old oath, from when he wore the trident on his chest: nobody gets left behind. He kept it in places that aren&#39;t on the maps. He doesn&#39;t know any other way to keep it.</p><p>@UUID[JournalEntry.LfywH6qtS3GxDxJx.JournalEntryPage.UmBoausZdK2xvygi]{Pregen: Cole Ransom · Operator}</p>",
    "appearance": "<p>Forty-nine, mustache, wrecked knees. Thinks he works for Homeland Security.</p>",
    "equipment": "",
    "notes": "",
    "privatenotes": "<h3>Proposed (not in the docs)</h3><ul><li>Conversion of the @UUID[Actor.abaWg7NwNQvM0sDc]{FIRSTLIGHT Tactical Team} pools (Physical 6, Social 2, Mental 4; Firearms 7, Athletics 5, Awareness 5, Brawl 5; Health 7, Willpower 5) to Attributes and Skills: Dexterity 3 + Firearms 4, Dexterity 3 + Athletics 2, Strength 3 + Brawl 2, Wits 3 + Awareness 2; Health = Stamina 4 + 3; Willpower = Composure 3 + Resolve 2. Ransom adds Wits 3 + Insight 3 = 6 (doc). Survival, Stealth, and Medicine are proposed (ex-SEAL).</li><li>Martial Creed, Oath Drive (“nobody gets left behind,” the SEAL one), and the Arsenal Edge (the armory in the port warehouse).</li><li>Incendiary ammunition is added because his carbine uses it (doc 14).</li><li>Ambition, desire, and Touchstone (the daughter in San Diego).</li></ul>",
